Expose bounded typed read/preview/apply/status/rollback/probe operations over the existing management service. Require admin grant and derive owner solely from OAuth; apply binds to reviewed base/candidate and impact, revalidating current authority. Add appropriate tool annotations and no-UI results. Acceptance: runtime-only clients cannot mutate config; stale/replayed/cross-user operations denied; tool results redact secrets and preserve bounded output. Implementation/local evidence: docs/specs/remote-configuration-acceptance.md. Production and native-host verification remain separate release gates.
